s = objects of the collaboration diagram; each action is done by the object of its lane." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="2041" width="972" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c64" value="Rounded boxes – actions;  diamonds – decisions;  thick bars – fork and join;  rectangles with dashed arrows – objects an action creates or reads." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="2060" width="972" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c65" value="Circle with a cross – flow final: the scenario ends without an answer;  bullseye – the normal end of the flow." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="2079" width="972" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c66" value="Only one fork: the graded-task check and the search in the slides are independent, so they run in parallel." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="2098" width="972" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c67" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="2000" width="980" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c68" value="Decisions of the use case UC-1 (Part 5)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1094" y="2012" width="952" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c69" value="“requests left?” – [no] is EXT-3 “Daily AI limit reached”: nothing is sent to the LLM." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1094" y="2041" width="952" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c70" value="“slides found?” – [no] is EXT-1 “Not found in the course materials”: nothing is sent to the LLM." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1094" y="2060" width="952" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c71" value="Graded lab (EXT-2) is not a decision that stops the flow: the task result only switches the LLM to “hints only”." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1094" y="2079" width="952" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c72" value="“reply in 30 s?” – [no] ends the flow (assumption);  the request is counted only after an answer is created." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1094" y="2098" width="952" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>